0, "playtime_at_review": 13169, "last_played": 1785185372, "avatar": "d9740e42f02d0433d21b2d699e46c67956295075"}, "language": "english", "review": "Deep Rock Galactic is wonderfully crafted, and as a player you can easily see how much tought, care and polish went into the game. Perfect game to play with friends or to find friends to play with.\nThe developer team is also a great example for all developers out there. Not a single gameplay content update was locked behind DLC or season pass, and there were lots over the years. All DLCs are cosmetic, completely optional and a way to support the devs and their way to do a game. I feel much more inclined to buy them than to buy some season passes out there.\nPlay it. Trust me.\nAlso this is my labour of love nominee :)\nEdit: LABOUR OF LOVE AGAIN BBY", "timestamp_created": 1637019362, "timestamp_updated": 1700703342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.566189050674438477", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102849466", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157809013", "personaname": "GrimXGB", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GrimXGB/", "num_games_owned": 587, "num_reviews": 110, "playtime_forever": 5980, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1781, "last_played": 1678729757, "avatar": "3c048bd8468117e67b86b1932299796184f1a935"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sock and Bone! I mean.... Rock and Stone!", "timestamp_created": 1637019304, "timestamp_updated": 1637019304, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", 